# Jira Custom Fields Reference

This document maps Jira custom field IDs to their corresponding field names. Use this reference when working with Jira API or tools that require custom field IDs.

## Field Mappings

| Custom Field ID | Field Name | Type | Description |
|----------------|------------|------|-------------|
| customfield_36004 | AMES - Project | dropdown | Used to specify the AMES project associated with a ticket |
| customfield_37928 | Automation API | dropdown | Used to specify API automation information |
| customfield_37929 | Automation UI | dropdown | Used to specify UI automation information |

## Usage Examples

### Updating a Custom Field

```javascript
// Example using the mcp_jira-mcp_updateCustomField tool
mcp_jira-mcp_updateCustomField({
  customFieldId: "customfield_36004",
  issueKey: "AASPIFRE-15569",
  fieldType: "dropdown",
  value: "CIS"
});
```

## Notes

- When adding new fields to this reference, include the field type (text, dropdown, multiselect, number, date, etc.)
- For dropdown fields, it's helpful to know the available options
- Fields may have different behaviors in different projects

## Common Custom Field Types

- **text**: Simple text fields
- **dropdown**: Single-select dropdown menus
- **multiselect**: Multi-select dropdown menus
- **number**: Numeric fields
- **date**: Date fields
- **checkbox**: Boolean fields
- **radiobuttons**: Radio button selection

